{"term":{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0001017","compactId":"SO_0001017","id":"SO:0001017","label":"silent_mutation","definition":{"text":"A sequence variant that does not affect protein function. Silent mutations may occur in genic ( CDS, UTR, intron etc) and intergenic regions. Silent mutations may have affects on processes such as splicing and regulation.","xrefs":["SO:ke"]},"comments":["Added in March 2007 in after meeting with PharmGKB. Although this term is in common usage, it is better to annotate with the most specific term possible, such as synonymous codon, intron variant etc."],"synonyms":[{"scope":"exact","value":"silent mutation"}],"xrefs":["http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Silent_mutation","loinc:LA6700-4"],"subsets":[],"altIds":[],"namespace":"sequence","isObsolete":false,"replacedBy":[],"canonicalUrl":"/browser/current_release/term/SO:0001017/","history":{"firstSeen":{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files","issueRefs":[]},"mostRecent":{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files","issueRefs":[]},"entries":[{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files","issueRefs":[]}],"semanticEvents":[{"type":"created","date":"2016-12-05","commit":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","subject":"Add renamed SO files","summary":"Term introduced into the editable ontology history","details":["Initial label: silent_mutation","Initial definition captured.","Initial parent: SO:0001878"],"issueRefs":[]}]},"parents":["SO:0001878"],"children":[],"ancestors":["SO:0001878","SO:0001537","SO:0001060"],"descendants":[],"relationships":[],"graphNeighborhood":{"parents":["http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0001878"],"children":[],"related":[]}},"graph":{"parents":[{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0